---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Decks
seoTitle: "Canadian Highlander decks to get you started · Canlander"
description: Canadian Highlander decklists from Moxfield to help you pick your first deck.
pageClass: decks
permalink: /decks/
---
{%- from "partials/macros.njk" import decktile -%}
<header class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="page-head__title">Decks to get you started</h1>
    <p class="page-head__lede">Canadian Highlander lists people are playing and updating on Moxfield. Find one that looks fun, copy it, and give it a few games before you start changing things.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="carousel carousel--feature" data-carousel>
    <div class="carousel__track" data-track tabindex="0" aria-label="Deck carousel">
      {%- for d in decks.decks | rotation %}
      <div class="carousel__slide">{{ decktile(d, decks.authors) }}</div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="carousel__controls">
      <button class="carousel__btn" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous decks">←</button>
      <span class="carousel__count mono" data-count></span>
      <button class="carousel__btn" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next decks">→</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section__head section__head--row decks-all">
    <h2 class="h3">All decks <span class="mono decks-count">{{ decks.decks.length }}</span></h2>
    <p class="mono decks-snap">Last refreshed {{ decks.snapshot | longDate }}</p>
  </div>
  <div class="deckgrid">
    {%- for d in decks.decks | rotation %}{{ decktile(d, decks.authors) }}{% endfor %}
  </div>

  <aside class="suggest">
    <div>
      <h2 class="h3">Want your deck on here?</h2>
      <p>Make it public on Moxfield with the format set to Canadian Highlander. Recently updated lists with more than {{ decks.rules.minViews }} views get added.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="https://mtgdecks.net/Canadian-Highlander">Tournament results ↗</a>
  </aside>
</div>
